This license applies to the source code of the animations you get from Native Animation, free or paid.

## You can

- Use the animations in **unlimited projects**, personal or commercial, including apps you build for clients.
- Modify the code in any way.
- Ship the compiled app to any store, on any platform.

## You cannot

- Resell, sublicense or redistribute the source code, modified or not, as a library, template, UI kit, starter, or
  any product whose main value is the code itself.
- Publish the source code in a public repository or package. Private repositories for your team are fine.
- Use the code to build a product that competes with Native Animation.

## Refunds end the license

If a purchase is refunded, the license for the refunded animations ends: you must stop using that code and delete
your copies.

## Seats

A license is for one developer. Teams need one license per developer who works with the code.

## No warranty

The code is provided as is. We test every animation against the versions listed on its page, but we cannot
guarantee it fits every project.
